{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>How</b> — Since he mentioned man and beast, he mentioned the nobler among men." "<b>How precious</b> — It is in construct state because of two, as if written: ומה יקרים בני אדם אשר בצל כנפיך יחסיון (how precious are the children of men who shelter in the shadow of Your wings), or: how precious to each one of them."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:29:47.909732182Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}